category: Math
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgomp1 liblapack0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Neighborhood Graph and Tree for Indexing High-dimensional Data (runtime)"
ldesc: "NGT provides commands and a library for performing high-speed approximate
nearest neighbor searches against a large volume of data (several million to
several 10 million items of data) in high dimensional vector data space
(several ten to several thousand dimensions)."
external-source: ngt

